        "description": "Weekly time available to follow the roadmap.\n\nThese buckets do not map onto the three-value set this service shipped\nwith: the old FOUR_TO_SEVEN_HOURS straddles FOUR_TO_SIX_HOURS and\nSEVEN_TO_TEN_HOURS, so a draft stored against the old vocabulary has to be\nasked again rather than translated.",
        "enum": [
          "LESS_THAN_ONE_HOUR",
          "ONE_TO_THREE_HOURS",
          "FOUR_TO_SIX_HOURS",
          "SEVEN_TO_TEN_HOURS",
          "MORE_THAN_TEN_HOURS"
        ],
        "title": "TimeCommitment",
        "type": "string"
      },
